Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Zero to {\c&H1A6AFF&}128{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H1A6AFF&}mph,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}in {\c&H1A6AFF&}3.5{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H1A6AFF&}seconds.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:07.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Kingda Ka was built for speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:09.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The real challenge was {\c&H1A6AFF&}stopping{\c&HFFFFFF&} it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Brake pads would wear out fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}So under every car sat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}rows of {\c&HFFE319&}rare-earth{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&HFFE319&}magnets.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}And on the track,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:17.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}thin {\c&H5A83D0&}copper{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H5A83D0&}fins.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:19.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}When a magnet sweeps past a fin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:22.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}it stirs up {\c&HFFE319&}swirling{\c&HFFFFFF&} electric currents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}inside the copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}{\c&HFFE319&}Eddy{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&HFFE319&}currents.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Those currents create a magnetic field
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:29.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}that {\c&HFFE319&}pushes{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&HFFE319&}back,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}turning the train's speed into {\c&H1A6AFF&}heat.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Nothing {\c&HFFE319&}touches.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:33.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Nothing wears {\c&HFFE319&}out.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:34.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}No power {\c&HFFE319&}needed.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}If a launch fell short
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}and the train rolled back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:39.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}{\c&H5A83D0&}fins{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H5A83D0&}popped{\c&HFFFFFF&} up to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Follow for how the world is really engineered.
